sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Agent
    participant MCPClient as MCP Client
    participant Transport as HTTP Transport
    participant Handler as HTTP Handler
    participant UseCase as Food Search UseCase
    participant Repo as Food Repository
    participant JSONData as JSON File
    
    Agent->>MCPClient: /api/v1/food/search?query=chicken
    MCPClient->>Transport: GET /api/v1/food/search
    Transport->>Handler: ServeRequest()
    Handler->>UseCase: Search(food string)
    
    UseCase->>Repo: Search(food string)
    Note right of Repo: Query JSON file, parse & filter
    
    Repo->>JSONData: Load data if not cached
    Note right of JSONData: File read (synchronous)
    
    opt Cache hit
        Repo-->>Repo: Return from memory cache
    else Cache miss
        Repo->>JSONData: Read nutrition_data.json
        par Process results
            Repo-->>UseCase: []*Food filtered results
        end
    end
    
    UseCase-->>Handler: Response
    Handler-->>Transport: HTTP 200 + JSON body
    Transport-->>MCPClient: MCP response (JSON)
    MCPClient-->>Agent: Structured nutrition data
